WEBVTT

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:14.530
Sometimes, I'm at a loss.

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:19.530
I'm responsible for more than
just the Kingdom of White.

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:24.820
When I became Queen of Light,
I really felt the weight of the balance.

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:29.690
If it comes loose, the very existence
of this world will waver.

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:33.030
That's how absolute a law it is.

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:37.280
Even I find it strange sometimes.

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:44.190
I order my people to fight the darkness,
but I'm complicit in its continued existence.

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:48.650
Has history always been like this?

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:54.730
Have light and darkness been balanced
while fighting and feuding with each other?

00:00:54.730 --> 00:00:57.440
I don't want to believe that.

00:00:57.440 --> 00:01:00.030
I don't want to,

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:03.190
but I can't change it.

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:05.780
Not alone.

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:08.280
All I can do on my own

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:10.900
is to maintain the present.

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:33.440
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:38.480
<i>Under the "light and dark" called justice</i>

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:43.110
<i>our wishes run aground in twilight</i>

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:50.480
<i>If you want the tomorrow</i>
<i>on the other side of the mirror,</i>

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:52.480
<i>go through nightmares</i>

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:57.440
<i>Lives fragmented like the sea and sky</i>

00:01:57.440 --> 00:02:01.980
<i>Even if we realize that</i>
<i>their resemblance is false,</i>

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:05.730
<i>we can at least not give it words, give it form,</i>

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:08.360
<i>or doubt our bonds</i>

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:14.110
<i>and tell ourselves that</i>
<i>even blindness is a mercy</i>

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:16.650
<i>White or black? The scales of Libra</i>

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:19.440
<i>waver cruelly</i>

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:24.650
<i>Together we cling, tenaciously,</i>
<i>to our sliver of a promise</i>

00:02:24.650 --> 00:02:26.690
<i>We looked up at a nebula</i>

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:29.650
<i>of numberless dystopias</i>

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:32.320
<i>I crawled through the mud, mind ablaze,</i>

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:36.940
<i>and met you on the far side</i>
<i>of the scales of Libra</i>

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:47.030
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:49.980
"Chapter 10"
"The Gentle Song of Darkness"

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:04.820
We've completed deployment,

00:03:04.820 --> 00:03:07.940
but will this be enough?

00:03:07.940 --> 00:03:11.230
Hurry back, Phious.

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:22.940
A dead end?

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:27.190
No, wait a moment.

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:30.400
Please use this.

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:32.360
This is...

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:34.530
Shall I show you the ropes?

00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:58.320
That way, perhaps?

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:00.820
Oh, I see.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:17.860
That will take getting used to.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.320
Now, let's go.

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:26.280
A straight path this time?

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:28.690
I can't see all the way.

00:04:28.690 --> 00:04:31.820
Who can say what it leads to?

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:33.730
Let's proceed with caution.

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:45.820
Let me!

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:01.150
It looks like I made it in time.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:02.820
Lady Sheama!

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:05.070
Now,

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:06.780
we'll return to the tower!

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:09.280
Knights, defend the people and the ground!

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:11.650
We will hold this place!

00:05:11.650 --> 00:05:13.440
--Yes, ma'am!
--Understood!

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:27.280
How long is this cave?

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:29.690
We don't have time for this.

00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:32.570
It's strange.

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:40.530
What's that?

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:54.940
We were about to keep walking forever.

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:07.900
Are you all right?!

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:09.570
We'll handle things here!

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:19.480
Now, hurry!

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:20.610
Right!

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:29.570
Lady Sheama, there are monsters in the city!

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:32.650
That's not good.

00:06:38.110 --> 00:06:39.730
What do I do?

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:46.320
Amazing.

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:49.650
You can do this without
calling on the Rune's power?

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:52.690
No, I am using it.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:57.610
I store it here.

00:06:57.610 --> 00:06:58.980
I see.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:01.980
But I suppose I should have expected that.

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:05.150
Only you could use such a powerful spell.

00:07:21.860 --> 00:07:23.280
Is that it?!

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:30.820
In that case...!

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:45.980
It seems there's a trick.

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:48.570
Let me try.

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:12.570
Lord Alantia, have you been here before?

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:15.530
No, the idea just came to me.

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:20.900
Either way, I could never have done this alone.

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.480
I knew it.

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:41.650
Those are the Shining Droplets?

00:08:41.650 --> 00:08:43.150
Wait!

00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:47.320
The Soul is too powerful.

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:50.110
No ordinary thing can contain it.

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:04.570
Let's withdraw to devise precautions.

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:05.650
No.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:15.690
Phious?!

00:09:20.190 --> 00:09:23.190
We have... no time!

00:09:23.190 --> 00:09:27.980
The darkness could be reaching out
its claws even as we speak!

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:34.070
I left Sheama in command,
but the knights are probably confused.

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:37.110
Still...

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:41.480
...Her Majesty is more important!

00:09:46.030 --> 00:09:49.610
Without her, the kingdom will...!

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:17.900
Phious.

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:19.150
Now...

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:21.400
...let's go.

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:31.940
Knights, lead the people to the palace!

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.150
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:35.860
We will--

00:10:50.030 --> 00:10:51.690
Your Majesty!

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:56.610
The linked incantation.

00:10:56.610 --> 00:10:57.980
Yes, Majesty!

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:02.610
Become manifest!

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:05.360
One of the seven powers:

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:08.820
Shield of Affection!

00:11:26.690 --> 00:11:28.070
This will stop them.

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:34.820
But the shield won't last long.

00:11:34.820 --> 00:11:37.320
We should return to the palace and...

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:38.940
Your Majesty!

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:47.110
What's happening?!

00:11:47.110 --> 00:11:49.360
It appears the darkness attacked.

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:52.110
Shield of Affection...

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:55.650
Her Majesty's power was likely
required to cast it on that scale.

00:11:58.360 --> 00:11:59.780
Your Majesty!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:16.000
"No. 10 Monsters"
"Naturally occurring monsters are hostile
to the people of both Black and White.
Some monsters are also employed by
the power of darkness."

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:27.110
Groza!

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:43.530
Your Highness.

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:52.070
We're safe now.

00:12:52.070 --> 00:12:53.230
Oh!

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:57.650
Thank you... very much!

00:12:57.650 --> 00:12:59.070
It was nothing.

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:01.320
More importantly,

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:03.110
how do we get back?

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:05.530
Th-That's a good question.

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:08.150
Oh!

00:13:08.150 --> 00:13:09.530
Maybe we could--

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:39.280
Here it comes!

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:50.730
What?!

00:13:50.730 --> 00:13:52.610
In that case...!

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:57.400
Huh?!

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:02.940
Your Highness!

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:25.320
Solitaire Orage!

00:14:39.030 --> 00:14:40.780
Your Highness!

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:42.900
That was a close one.

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:45.900
Thanks, Groza.

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.940
D-Don't mention it.

00:14:49.190 --> 00:14:53.280
Now, Your Highness, let's go home.

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:57.570
What's wrong?

00:14:57.570 --> 00:15:02.400
Do you think we'll ever get to visit
the Kingdom of White again?

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:05.110
I wonder.

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:09.070
I don't know what the King of Darkness
might be thinking.

00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:13.280
But either way, after everything
that happened...

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:19.440
Oh, I know!

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:22.400
I got some fresh fish today.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.360
Would you care to join me?

00:15:32.980 --> 00:15:35.730
Please, enjoy your meal.

00:15:38.070 --> 00:15:43.230
As the next King of Darkness,
you need plenty of nourishment.

00:15:43.230 --> 00:15:45.400
The King of Darkness...

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:48.610
Can I really...

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:55.070
What darkness envelopes is being itself.

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:57.570
Good, evil, everything.

00:15:58.610 --> 00:16:02.570
Darkness must never lift.

00:16:02.570 --> 00:16:06.570
It will continue to expand
as long as there is space.

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:11.530
That has been the truth
of this world since its birth.

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:14.730
The truth?

00:16:14.730 --> 00:16:17.610
I can't accept any of that.

00:16:17.610 --> 00:16:20.940
I don't even want to understand it.

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:24.900
My promise with the Queen of Light
is more important.

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:27.820
What are you talking about?!

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:31.400
You're going to be responsible for this kingdom!

00:16:31.400 --> 00:16:33.190
Please say something!

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:37.030
Tell me about your vision for our future!

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:40.940
I'll stay with you and
support you in realizing it!

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:43.570
Besides, I...

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:51.480
Ever since we first met, I've...

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:02.360
...adored you.

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:32.530
Deep down...

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:38.780
...you want a future with Iris,
the Queen of Light, don't you?

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:48.980
I see.

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:52.900
In that case... I...

00:17:56.570 --> 00:17:57.940
Groza!

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:05.730
I'll still...

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:07.980
...stand by you.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:09.610
I'll always

00:18:09.610 --> 00:18:11.900
keep supporting you.

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:20.690
Sheama! I've returned!

00:18:20.690 --> 00:18:23.110
Phious?! What happened to you?!

00:18:23.110 --> 00:18:24.780
The details can wait!

00:18:24.780 --> 00:18:27.110
Give this to Her Majesty!

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:30.860
This is...!

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:51.360
Well?

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:53.650
Yes, this will work.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:59.230
I just got back.

00:18:59.230 --> 00:19:01.480
Is Her Majesty better?

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:02.730
Yes.

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:10.440
This is it, Phious.

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:14.900
While you were gone, the darkness...

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:17.480
I heard what happened from the knights.

00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:20.320
I'm sorry.

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:22.780
The shield won't hold for long.

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:25.230
The mages are still...

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:26.400
I know.

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:30.070
Once we're prepared, we'll drop the shield.

00:19:30.070 --> 00:19:31.780
Then...

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:32.980
Yes.

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:41.230
At this rate,

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:44.780
I won't even be able to maintain the present.

00:19:49.070 --> 00:19:52.360
What should I do?

00:19:53.320 --> 00:19:56.730
My wish is the same.

00:19:56.730 --> 00:20:01.940
If it will make everyone
in both our kingdoms happy,

00:20:01.940 --> 00:20:06.940
I'll support you, even from down in the mud.

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:13.610
I want you to follow

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:15.570
that path you believe in.

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:26.610
The path I believe in...

00:20:26.610 --> 00:20:30.650
...is a path with you.

00:20:31.570 --> 00:20:33.070
Your Majesty.

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:37.070
I realize you are praying fervently,

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:39.820
but please don't push yourself too hard.

00:20:39.820 --> 00:20:43.610
The decisive battle with
darkness is close at hand.

00:20:44.730 --> 00:20:46.400
I'm sorry.

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:49.440
I didn't mean to worry a knight like you.

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:53.940
No, it is our duty to defend Your Majesty.

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:56.900
Thank you, Phious.

00:20:56.900 --> 00:20:59.280
P-Please, there's no need.

00:20:59.280 --> 00:21:01.780
At least let me thank you.

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:07.440
You and Sheama have always done so much for me.

00:21:07.440 --> 00:21:13.780
Pardon my insolence,
but we siblings treasure Your Majesty...

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:19.650
...more as family than as our queen.

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:22.780
Thank you very much.

00:21:22.780 --> 00:21:28.480
I want to give you my
heartfelt thanks as family as well.

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:29.690
Majesty.

00:21:29.690 --> 00:21:34.230
I will not allow the forces of Black
to touch a hair on Your Majesty's head.

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:36.940
I swear it on my honor.

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:38.730
Thank you very much.

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:41.530
You're thanking me too much.

00:21:41.530 --> 00:21:43.320
I suppose I am.

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:46.360
Please take some rest soon.

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:48.480
I will. Goodbye.

00:22:16.570 --> 00:22:21.320
<i>I walk the quiet streets alone</i>

00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:24.940
<i>in my memories</i>

00:22:26.150 --> 00:22:28.400
<i>The times I can't see you</i>

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:34.730
<i>lead me a little astray, a fleeting light</i>

00:22:34.730 --> 00:22:44.190
<i>I want to touch your darkness,</i>

00:22:44.190 --> 00:22:54.400
<i>what lies beyond it and its truth</i>

00:22:54.400 --> 00:22:57.940
<i>Let me light your darkness</i>

00:22:57.940 --> 00:23:00.730
<i>Even if we're apart</i>

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:07.440
<i>Won't you let me light your darkness?</i>

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:10.230
<i>I'll find you</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:18.650
<i>Run, light,</i>

00:23:18.650 --> 00:23:21.980
<i>to where you are</i>

00:23:21.980 --> 00:23:24.820
<i>Through the dark</i>

00:23:26.730 --> 00:23:30.150
<i>Through the dark</i>

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.030
"Next Time"
